  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #7c3aed; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem 0; line-height: 1.2;\">Materi 1.1.2b: Rumus Suku ke-n Aritmatika</h1><p>Setelah lo paham konsep dasar pola aritmatika, sekarang saatnya belajar senjata paling ampuh: <strong>Rumus Suku ke-n</strong>!</p><p>Dengan rumus ini, lo bisa langsung tau nilai suku ke-100, ke-1000, bahkan ke-sejuta tanpa perlu nulis barisannya satu-satu. Keren kan? 😎</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #8b5cf6; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.875rem 0; line-height: 1.3; border-bottom: 2px solid #e9d5ff; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Rumus Suku ke-n: The Magic Formula!</h2><p>Ini dia rumus yang bakal jadi <strong>senjata utama</strong> lo:</p>\n      <div class=\"cte-katex-equation cte-katex-block\" data-latex=\"U_n%20%3D%20a%20%2B%20(n%20-%201)b\" data-display-mode=\"true\" data-editable=\"true\" data-has-handlers=\"true\">\n        <span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>\n      </div>\n    <p><strong>Keterangan:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>U<sub>n</sub></strong> = suku ke-n (yang mau dicari)</li><li><strong>a</strong> = suku pertama (U<sub>1</sub>)</li><li><strong>n</strong> = nomor urut suku</li><li><strong>b</strong> = beda (selisih antar suku)</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #8b5cf6; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.875rem 0; line-height: 1.3; border-bottom: 2px solid #e9d5ff; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Kenapa Rumusnya Gitu?</h2><p>Mari kita bedah pake logika:</p><p>Barisan: a, a+b, a+2b, a+3b, a+4b, ...</p><ul><li>U<sub>1</sub> = a</li><li>U<sub>2</sub> = a + b = a + (2-1)b</li><li>U<sub>3</sub> = a + 2b = a + (3-1)b</li><li>U<sub>4</sub> = a + 3b = a + (4-1)b</li><li>U<sub>5</sub> = a + 4b = a + (5-1)b</li><li>...</li><li>U<sub>n</sub> = a + (n-1)b</li></ul>\n      <div class=\"cte-key-concept-block tw-my-4 tw-rounded-lg tw-shadow-sm tw-transition-all\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #0891B2; background-color: #ECFEFF;\" data-style=\"insight\">\n        <div class=\"tw-p-4\">\n          <div class=\"tw-flex tw-items-center tw-mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"tw-rounded-lg tw-p-2 tw-mr-2 tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center\" style=\"background-color: #0891B2;\">\n              <svg class=\"tw-w-5 tw-h-5 tw-text-white\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"tw-text-base tw-font-semibold tw-m-0\" style=\"color: #164E63;\">\n              Insight\n            </h4>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"tw-rounded-lg tw-p-3\">\n            <div class=\"tw-leading-relaxed cte-key-concept-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height: 2.5rem; max-height: none; height: auto; outline: none; overflow: visible; background: transparent; color: #164E63;\">\n              Jadi, untuk sampai ke suku ke-n, kita mulai dari a (suku pertama), terus nambah b sebanyak (n-1) kali!\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #8b5cf6; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.875rem 0; line-height: 1.3; border-bottom: 2px solid #e9d5ff; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Contoh Penggunaan Rumus</h2><p><strong>Contoh 1: Mencari Suku Tertentu</strong></p><p>Dari barisan 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, ... tentukan U<sub>100</sub>!</p><p><strong>Penyelesaian:</strong></p><p><strong>Step 1: Identifikasi</strong></p><ul><li>a = 7</li><li>b = 11 - 7 = 4</li><li>n = 100</li></ul><p><strong>Step 2: Masukkan ke rumus</strong></p><p>U<sub>100</sub> = 7 + (100-1) × 4<br>U<sub>100</sub> = 7 + 99 × 4<br>U<sub>100</sub> = 7 + 396<br>U<sub>100</sub> = 403</p><p><strong>Contoh 2: Menyederhanakan Rumus</strong></p><p>Dari barisan yang sama, buat rumus umum yang disederhanakan!</p><p>U<sub>n</sub> = 7 + (n-1) × 4<br>U<sub>n</sub> = 7 + 4n - 4<br>U<sub>n</sub> = 4n + 3</p><p>Sekarang lebih simple! Untuk cari U<sub>100</sub>: U<sub>100</sub> = 4(100) + 3 = 403 ✓</p>\n      <div class=\"cte-card-grid-block tw-my-4\" data-style=\"blue\" data-columns=\"2\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px;\">\n        \n        <div class=\"cte-card-grid-item\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #2196f3; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\n          <div class=\"cte-card-header\" style=\"background: #2196f3; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem;\" contenteditable=\"true\">\n            💡 Tips Praktis #1\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cte-card-content\" style=\"padding: 16px; color: #212121; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5;\" contenteditable=\"true\">\n            <p><strong>Selalu sederhanakan rumus!</strong></p><p>Dari U<sub>n</sub> = a + (n-1)b<br>Jadi U<sub>n</sub> = bn + (a-b)</p><p>Ini lebih cepat untuk perhitungan!</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"cte-card-grid-item\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #2196f3; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\n          <div class=\"cte-card-header\" style=\"background: #2196f3; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem;\" contenteditable=\"true\">\n            ⚡ Tips Praktis #2\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cte-card-content\" style=\"padding: 16px; color: #212121; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5;\" contenteditable=\"true\">\n            <p><strong>Hati-hati dengan tanda!</strong></p><p>Kalau b negatif, WAJIB pake kurung:<br>U<sub>n</sub> = a + (n-1) × <strong>(−b)</strong></p><p>Jangan lupa kurungnya!</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n      </div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #8b5cf6; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.875rem 0; line-height: 1.3; border-bottom: 2px solid #e9d5ff; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Menentukan Pola dari Barisan</h2><p>Kadang soal UTBK nggak ngasih tau langsung \"ini barisan aritmatika lho!\". Lo harus <strong>detective</strong> sendiri!</p><p><strong>Step-by-step:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Cek selisih</strong> antar suku berurutan</li><li>Kalau selisihnya <strong>sama semua</strong> → ARITMATIKA! ✓</li><li>Catat nilai <strong>a</strong> (suku pertama) dan <strong>b</strong> (beda)</li><li>Tulis rumus umumnya: U<sub>n</sub> = a + (n-1)b</li><li>Sederhanakan jadi U<sub>n</sub> = bn + (a-b)</li></ol>\n      <div class=\"cte-key-concept-block tw-my-4 tw-rounded-lg tw-shadow-sm tw-transition-all\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #1D4ED8; background-color: #DBEAFE;\" data-style=\"goal\">\n        <div class=\"tw-p-4\">\n          <div class=\"tw-flex tw-items-center tw-mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"tw-rounded-lg tw-p-2 tw-mr-2 tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center\" style=\"background-color: #1D4ED8;\">\n              <svg class=\"tw-w-5 tw-h-5 tw-text-white\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM9.555 7.168A1 1 0 008 8v4a1 1 0 001.555.832l3-2a1 1 0 000-1.664l-3-2z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"tw-text-base tw-font-semibold tw-m-0\" style=\"color: #1E3A8A;\">\n              Key Takeaway\n            </h4>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"tw-rounded-lg tw-p-3\">\n            <div class=\"tw-leading-relaxed cte-key-concept-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height: 2.5rem; max-height: none; height: auto; outline: none; overflow: visible; background: transparent; color: #1E3A8A;\">\n              Dengan rumus U<sub>n</sub> = a + (n-1)b, lo bisa mencari nilai suku ke berapapun tanpa harus menulis seluruh barisan!\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    <p>Next, kita akan belajar <strong>tips dan trik UTBK</strong> untuk ngerjain soal aritmatika dengan lebih cepat! ⚡</p>",
  "exportDate": "2026-01-26T14:17:12.520Z",
  "exportVersion": "1.0"
}
